# 暂停着失活也真存盘（第二阶段 4a0710f，iOS）：暂停菜单开着时游戏不走拍，原先「下一拍存」永远不存；现在失活时冻结世界、放开暂停存一次
# Resigning while paused really saves (phase 2, 4a0710f, iOS): with the pause menu open the game does not tick, so the old "save on the next tick" never saved; now resigning freezes the world and releases the pause for one save
name resign_paused_saves
requires ios-mac device
save warlock
timeout 180

enter_game
open_pause
app resign
expect save result=commit timeout=6
app active
close_pause
expect_state in_game=true
quit
check no_red
check no_red_log
